      "reasoning": "All eleven frozen SolutionRecipe occurrences explicitly reference JCM403 thiamine solution via mediadive.compound1856. JCM403 defines 10mg Thiamine HCl in100ml sodium phosphate buffer25mM pH3.4. Receiving-medium dose differs among occurrences and does not change the stock identity. Filtration attribution is source-specific: explicit in NBRC 1321 and JCM 1125, not explicitly stated for the stock in JCM 403 or established by the unexplained JCM 1468 asterisk.",
