      "disposition": "unresolved",
      "reasoning": "The source Eisencitrat appears in Chelated iron solution3183 with citric acid. Live MediaDive1401 wrongly attaches deoxyguanosine-phosphate synonyms,CAS and CHEBI:55553 while reportingC6H8FeO7. OLS144421 is iron(III)citrate with different explicit stoichiometry. Neither the German generic name nor calculatedmM proves exact144421. Final correction: TOGO M565, linked to JCM 561, explicitly doses 5 ml Ferric citrate (0.1%, w/v). The literal names a supplied stock, not a neat iron(III) citrate molecule. Mark only this stock label REJECTED_LABEL on CHEBI:144421 and preserve its raw text/source/history. This does not settle the separate Eisencitrat oxidation, stoichiometry or hydration uncertainty or approve other inherited labels.",
