          "at": "2026-11-08T09:36:52.125256+00:00",
          "assessment": "The complete Difco RCM manufacturer formula explicitly names generic Peptone at10 g per litre of standard reconstitution. This supports the named generic protein-digest part without inventing a supplier, substrate, enzyme or Bacto identity. The final reviewed generic Peptone proposal W05-FINAL-MAT-039 supplies the conditional exact target. Its target acceptance/application is a separate dependency, not a missing supplier fact about this generic named input. The earlier attribution to the20-claim #1176 consumer ledger was incorrect: that ledger contains no RCM claim. Marine Broth's separately directed peptone withdrawal is preserved. All nominal quantities, COMPLETE nine printed inputs, approximate/performance-adjustment footnote and unknown lot formulation remain unchanged.",
